  "description": "The Cross 300 is a dedicated fitness and commuting machine designed for riders who prioritize speed and efficiency. Unlike basic 21-speed cruisers, this model features a Shimano Altus 24-speed drivetrain. The expanded gear range is engineered for performance; it allows you to maintain a high cadence on long straightaways and stay seated during steep climbs, significantly reducing knee strain compared to lower-tier setups.\nAt just 30 lbs, the lightweight alloy frame is paired with a Zoom 50mm suspension fork to dampen road chatter. The flat-bar geometry provides an athletic, responsive feel, making it perfect for weaving through traffic or hitting fitness goals. To ensure a custom-feel ride, we offer three distinct frame sizes (17”, 19.5”, and 21.5”), accommodating riders from 5'5\" up to 6'5\". Please refer to our sizing chart below to find your perfect fit.\nElevate your ride.",
